- C17: data_class present with the (s, delta, norm) core: symmetry slot, differentiability class, norm/gauge; no TBD placeholders.
- C18: genericity present, generic set kind == residual_comeager, excluded set required meager (not asserted constructed).
- C19: non_vacuity present with a falsifiable condition.
- C20: i_plus clause present with a defined I+ topology / construction.
- C21: visibility clause present and single canonical predicate (no competing definitions).

